---
import BookCTA from '../components/BookCTA.astro';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Divider from '../components/Divider.astro';
---
<Base title={"Therapy in Sandy, UT | Tangible Therapy"} description={"Therapy in Sandy, UT at Tangible Therapy — EMDR, anxiety, trauma specialists. Insurance accepted, avg $25/session. Book a free 15-min consult."}>
<section class="sec t-light-bold h-custom">
<div class="sec-in" style="padding-top: calc(0vmax / 10); padding-bottom: calc(0vmax / 10);">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:22;--mrows:33">
  <div class="b b-map jc" style="--d:3/16/20/26;--m:23/2/33/10;--dz:5;--mz:5"><div class="map"><iframe title="Map of 11075 S State St, Bldg #33, Sandy, UT 84070" src="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=11075%20S%20State%20St%2C%20Bldg%20%2333%2C%20Sandy%2C%20UT%2084070&z=15&output=embed" loading="lazy"></iframe></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:4/2/9/14;--m:2/2/7/10"><div class="rte"><h1><span class="c-black">Join Us at Tangible Therapy in Sandy.</span></h1></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:9/2/12/14;--m:7/2/11/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><p class="lg"><span class="c-black">Real support, close to home; expert mental health care serving Sandy and the Salt Lake Valley.</span></p></div></div>
  <div class="b b-button jc" style="--d:13/2/15/7;--m:11/3/13/9;--dz:6;--mz:6"><div class="btn-wrap ta-center"><a class="btn btn-primary btn-medium btn-full" href="tel:4352605406">Call Tangible Therapy</a></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:16/2/17/14;--m:14/2/15/10;--dz:3;--mz:3"><div class="rte"><h4><span class="c-black">Tangible Therapy Sandy in a Nutshell</span></h4></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:17/2/21/14;--m:15/2/23/10;--dz:3;--mz:3"><div class="rte"><p><span class="c-black">Tangible Therapy is an Award-winning therapy clinic in Sandy, Utah offering individual counseling, couples therapy, EMDR, trauma treatment, anxiety and depression therapy, and more. Sessions cost $115 cash pay or an average of $25 with insurance. Most major insurance plans are accepted, including SelectHealth, BCBS, and United Healthcare.</span></p></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-light h-medium">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:14;--mrows:26">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:1/2/5/14;--m:1/2/5/10"><div class="rte"><h2><strong>Bringing hope and healing closer to home in Sandy</strong></h2></div></div>
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:1/15/13/26;--m:20/2/27/10;--dz:3;--mz:3"><figure class="img fill" style="--r:50px"><img src="/images/adobestock-843469970-60b823.jpg" alt="A calm waiting area with two armchairs, plants and large windows at Tangible Therapy in Sandy, Utah" width="5376" height="3584" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:5/2/11/14;--m:5/2/17/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><p>Finding time for therapy is hard enough. Finding a therapist who's genuinely skilled, affordable, and close to where you live? That's the part that stops most people from ever starting.</p><p>Tangible Therapy's Sandy location brings the same award-winning care we're known for in Utah Valley, directly to the Salt Lake Valley. Whether you're in Sandy, Draper, South Jordan, Murray, Midvale, or anywhere nearby, you have access to a team of highly trained therapists ready to help.</p></div></div>
  <div class="b b-button jc" style="--d:11/2/13/8;--m:17/2/19/10;--dz:4;--mz:4"><div class="btn-wrap ta-center"><a class="btn btn-primary btn-medium btn-full" href="tel:4352828086">Call Tangible Therapy</a></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-white-bold h-custom">
<div class="sec-in" style="padding-top: calc(10vmax / 10); padding-bottom: calc(10vmax / 10);">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:12;--mrows:30">
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:2/2/13/13;--m:19/2/28/10"><figure class="img fill" style="--r:50px"><img src="/images/chatgpt-image-apr-28-2026-10-48-20-am-6dfc19.jpg" alt="A smiling therapist takes notes while meeting with a client in a cozy office at Tangible Therapy in Sandy, Utah" width="1402" height="1122" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-html jc" style="--d:2/14/4/26;--m:2/2/5/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><h2><strong>What Makes us Different?</strong></h2></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:4/14/12/26;--m:5/2/19/10;--dz:3;--mz:3"><div class="rte"><p><span class="c-accent">We don't just meet the standard, we set it. Every therapist at our Sandy office receives twice the industry-standard training, with all trainings at certification level. That means when you sit down with one of our clinicians, you're working with someone who has genuine, verified expertise in what you're going through, not just a license.</span></p><p><span class="c-accent">We're the top-rated therapy clinic on Google in Utah, and the recipient of Best Counseling Center of Utah Valley two years running and Utah's Best of State award. We're proud of those honors, but what they really reflect is something simpler: clients who came in struggling and left better.</span></p></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-light h-medium">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:10;--mrows:27">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:1/2/5/14;--m:1/2/4/10"><div class="rte"><h2><strong>Therapy that doesn’t cost a fortune</strong></h2></div></div>
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:1/15/11/26;--m:14/2/28/10;--dz:3;--mz:3"><figure class="img fill" style="--r:50px"><img src="/images/chatgpt-image-apr-28-2026-10-46-19-am-921597.jpg" alt="A therapist with glasses listens to a client in a warm therapy office at Tangible Therapy in Sandy, Utah" width="1402" height="1122" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:5/2/10/14;--m:4/2/14/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><p>We believe cost should never be the reason someone doesn't get help. Our cash pay rate is just <strong>$115 per session</strong>, one of the lowest in the area. And if you have insurance, our average client pays only <strong>$25 per session</strong>.</p><p>We accept most major insurance plans including SelectHealth, Blue Cross Blue Shield, United Healthcare, PEHP, DMBA, EMI, Tricare, and UMR. If you're not sure whether we take your plan, reach out — we'll check before your first appointment.</p></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-white-bold h-custom">
<div class="sec-in" style="padding-top: calc(10vmax / 10); padding-bottom: calc(10vmax / 10);">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:14;--mrows:31">
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:2/2/14/13;--m:20/2/29/10"><figure class="img fill" style="--r:50px"><img src="/images/chatgpt-image-apr-28-2026-10-50-42-am-22645d.jpg" alt="A therapist in a cream sweater listens to a client in a calm, lamp-lit office at Tangible Therapy in Sandy, Utah" width="1402" height="1122" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-html jc" style="--d:2/14/6/26;--m:2/2/6/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><h2>Specialists in what you're actually dealing with.</h2></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:6/14/13/26;--m:6/2/20/10;--dz:3;--mz:3"><div class="rte"><p><span class="c-accent">Every therapist at our Sandy office is trained in </span><a href="/emdr-therapy"><span class="c-accent">EMDR</span></a><span class="c-accent"> — one of the most effective, research-backed treatments for trauma and anxiety available. Many of our clinicians also hold advanced certifications in:</span></p><ul><li><p><span class="c-accent"><strong>Gottman Method</strong> — for </span><a href="/couples-counseling"><span class="c-accent">couples and relationship work</span></a></p></li><li><p><a href="/ifs"><span class="c-accent"><strong>Internal Family Systems</strong></span></a><span class="c-accent"><strong> (IFS)</strong> — Level 1 certified</span></p></li><li><p><span class="c-accent"><strong>CBT, DBT, and somatic therapies</strong></span></p></li></ul><p><span class="c-accent">Whatever you're navigating — </span><a href="/anxiety-therapy"><span class="c-accent">anxiety</span></a><span class="c-accent">, </span><a href="/depression-therapy"><span class="c-accent">depression</span></a><span class="c-accent">, </span><a href="/trauma-therapy"><span class="c-accent">trauma,</span></a><span class="c-accent"> relationship stress, </span><a href="/ocd-treatment"><span class="c-accent">OCD</span></a><span class="c-accent">, </span><a href="/adhd-therapy"><span class="c-accent">ADHD</span></a><span class="c-accent">, </span><a href="/grief-therapy"><span class="c-accent">grief</span></a><span class="c-accent">, or a </span><a href="/faith-transition-therapy"><span class="c-accent">faith transition</span></a><span class="c-accent"> — we have a therapist who specializes in it.</span></p></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-light h-medium">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:12;--mrows:25">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:1/2/4/14;--m:1/2/4/10"><div class="rte"><h3>Serving Sandy and the greater Salt Lake Valley</h3></div></div>
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:1/15/13/26;--m:16/2/25/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><figure class="img fill" style="--r:50px"><img src="/images/chatgpt-image-apr-26-2026-09-02-25-pm-266434.jpg" alt="A man smiles during a telehealth therapy session on his laptop with Tangible Therapy in Sandy, Utah" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:4/2/10/14;--m:4/2/13/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><p>Our Sandy office is conveniently located for clients throughout <strong>Sandy, Draper, South Jordan, Riverton, Herriman, Murray, Midvale, West Jordan, and Salt Lake City</strong>. Can't make it in person? Telehealth appointments are available for anyone in Utah. </p><p>11075 S State St Bldg #33 Sandy, UT 84070<br/>435-260-5406<br/><a href="mailto:frontdesk@tangiblementalhealth.com"><span class="c-black">frontdesk@tangiblementalhealth.com</span></a></p></div></div>
  <div class="b b-button jc" style="--d:10/2/12/8;--m:13/3/15/9;--dz:6;--mz:6"><div class="btn-wrap ta-center"><a class="btn btn-primary btn-medium btn-full" href="/contact">Contact Tangible Therapy</a></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-bright-inverse h-small has-div" style="--divh:6vw">
<div class="sec-in" style="padding-top:6.6vmax;padding-bottom:6.6vmax">
<div class="wrap"><div class="list-title rte"><p>What you’ll get</p></div><ul class="ulist ulist-carousel" style="--per:3;--ar:3/2;--tfs:calc((2.2 - 1) * var(--fs-unit) + 1rem);--bfs:calc((1.2 - 1) * var(--fs-unit) + 1rem);--cw:75%;--gap:20px"><li class="li"><a class="li-link" href="#" aria-label="✺"></a><div class="li-body"><h3 class="li-title">✺</h3><div class="rte li-desc"><p>50-minute sessions with a highly trained clinician</p></div></div></li><li class="li"><div class="li-body"><h3 class="li-title">✺</h3><div class="rte li-desc"><p>Specialists in anxiety, depression, trauma, EMDR, OCD, and more</p></div></div></li><li class="li"><div class="li-body"><h3 class="li-title">✺</h3><div class="rte li-desc"><p>Couples, individual, and family therapy available</p></div></div></li><li class="li"><div class="li-body"><h3 class="li-title">✺</h3><div class="rte li-desc"><p>Most major insurance plans accepted</p></div></div></li><li class="li"><div class="li-body"><h3 class="li-title">✺</h3><div class="rte li-desc"><p>One of the lowest cash pay rates in Salt Lake County</p></div></div></li><li class="li"><a class="li-link" href="/" aria-label="✺"></a><div class="li-body"><h3 class="li-title">✺</h3><div class="rte li-desc"><p>Telehealth available if you prefer to meet online</p></div></div></li></ul><div class="carousel-nav"><button class="prev" aria-label="Previous"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 12H5m6-6-6 6 6 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button><button class="next" aria-label="Next"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button></div></div>
</div>
<Divider type="wavy" height={6} width={100} fill="#565d57" /></section>

<section class="sec t-light h-medium has-div" style="--divh:8vw">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:2;--mrows:2">
  <div class="b b-marquee jc" style="--d:1/2/3/26;--m:1/2/3/10;--dz:10;--mz:10"><div class="marquee" aria-label="We Offer a free 15 Minute consult with a therapist!"><div class="marquee-track"><span>We Offer a free 15 Minute consult with a therapist!</span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true">✺</span><span>We Offer a free 15 Minute consult with a therapist!</span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true">✺</span><span>We Offer a free 15 Minute consult with a therapist!</span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true">✺</span><span>We Offer a free 15 Minute consult with a therapist!</span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true">✺</span><span>We Offer a free 15 Minute consult with a therapist!</span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true">✺</span><span>We Offer a free 15 Minute consult with a therapist!</span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true">✺</span><span>We Offer a free 15 Minute consult with a therapist!</span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true">✺</span><span>We Offer a free 15 Minute consult with a therapist!</span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true">✺</span><span>We Offer a free 15 Minute consult with a therapist!</span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true">✺</span><span>We Offer a free 15 Minute consult with a therapist!</span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true">✺</span><span>We Offer a free 15 Minute consult with a therapist!</span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true">✺</span><span>We Offer a free 15 Minute consult with a therapist!</span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true">✺</span></div></div></div>
</div>
<BookCTA />
</div>
<Divider type="scalloped" height={8} width={100} fill="#acb9ac" flipX /></section>

<section class="sec t-black h-small">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:4;--mrows:8">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:1/7/3/21;--m:1/2/3/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><h2 class="ta-center"><strong>What our clients say</strong></h2></div></div>
  <div class="b b-code" style="--d:4/4/5/24;--m:3/2/9/10"><!-- Elfsight Google Reviews | Tangible Reviews -->
<script is:inline async="" src="https://elfsightcdn.com/platform.js"></script>
<div class="elfsight-app-299117ef-b3ca-4f85-b852-48a645b1a46a" data-elfsight-app-lazy=""></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-white-bold h-medium">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:11;--mrows:20">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:1/2/3/26;--m:1/2/4/10"><div class="rte"><h2 class="ta-center">✺ Frequently asked questions ✺</h2></div></div>
  <div class="b b-accordion" style="--d:4/2/12/13;--m:5/2/13/10"><div class="accordion"><details><summary>Do you accept insurance at the Sandy location?</summary><div class="rte"><p>Yes. We accept most major insurance plans at all of our locations, including Sandy. Coverage and copays are the same as our Orem and Provo offices. Our average client with insurance pays around $25 per session.</p></div></details><details><summary>What types of therapy are available in Sandy?</summary><div class="rte"><p>Individual counseling, couples therapy, trauma therapy, EMDR, anxiety and depression treatment, OCD therapy, ADHD support, grief counseling, teen therapy, and faith transition counseling are all available at our Sandy location.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do I have to live in Sandy to see a therapist there?</summary><div class="rte"><p>No, our Sandy office is open to anyone in the Salt Lake Valley or surrounding areas. If coming in person isn't convenient, we also offer telehealth for anywhere in Utah.</p></div></details></div></div>
  <div class="b b-accordion" style="--d:4/15/9/26;--m:13/2/21/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="accordion"><details><summary>How quickly can I get an appointment?</summary><div class="rte"><p>We typically have openings within the same week. Browse our team page to find a therapist whose specializations match what you're working through, then book directly online.</p></div></details><details><summary>Is telehealth available?</summary><div class="rte"><p>Yes. All of our therapists offer telehealth sessions for clients anywhere in Utah — same therapist, same quality of care, from wherever is most comfortable for you.</p></div></details><details><summary>What is the cost without insurance?</summary><div class="rte"><p>Our cash pay rate is $115 per session, one of the lowest available in Sandy and the Salt Lake Valley area.</p></div></details></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</Base>
